  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "An inverted conical flask is being filled with water at the rate of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The height of the flask is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and the radius of the base is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. How fast is the water level rising when the level is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>?</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "aWp7O",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yYB1T",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a9DUy",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VJmug",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
